)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/8a734d7d-8e00-4610-914e-30c6f6c7f5fc/8daaeb93-f251-4253-8e63-e55970985ab7" alt="A person&#x27;s hands pouring the contents of a stick pack into a green HydraPak soft flask." class="r-eurdg2" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="06e6d9eb-0c28-4287-a8d1-051d5777285d" class="r-1jeh5nv"><div data-replo-marquee-root="true" data-rid="4448b1dc-d027-405e-9a93-a0beb819d8fc" class="r-1imctjy"><div class="r-1vwvy1x" data-replo-marquee-track="true"><div data-rid="b189cb44-51fe-4b09-bc03-5510da0f7a21" class="r-dtiklk"><div data-rid="717edcb1-68bd-4ac0-98e7-7e4a18bde35e" class="r-1xcw8v8"><div data-rid="34dca6ed-6195-48d5-a18e-5fa2b6aadcfc" class="r-18vcs0p alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>PUMPED!</p></span></div><div data-rid="b8e1f063-e40b-4ea0-bacb-ecc64c0c6ba5" class="r-18ycjlu alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tastes great. Not sweet, so don't expect it to be. Mixes well. I feel freaking GOOD!!</p></span></div><div data-rid="5467b192-ca2a-4762-ab32-7ca337211ff8" class="r-h2rpf1 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ashton B</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="6b3ede2d-aa70-4d9d-a182-27e400cf4b9e" class="r-1vnzuqo"><div data-rid="f3e994fc-e82b-4c95-8195-68fdcb02f07d" class="r-r6chw5 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e6710-styles-4e9e1fb4-94ca-474b-82ac-38d78f5aef1d-attributes-color:#ffffff"><span style="width:100%"><p>LOVE THIS STUFF</p></span></div><div data-rid="d4a9fc3a-02a3-4697-9a2a-f3023597d924" class="r-35cyzn alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-c1a8c56f-d134-48db-bdea-c4ba0a1e671